{"id":"9c689c9dc8aac6ab","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations.md","title":"Shoenfield Sigma Ring and Generated Class","display":"df-sigma-ring-of-relations — Shoenfield Sigma Ring and Generated Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations","aliases":["68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations"],"display":"df-sigma-ring-of-relations — Shoenfield Sigma Ring and Generated Class","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§20 p.76 / PDF 85, definition preceding 20.3","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"existence-and-minimality-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-ring-of-relations — Shoenfield Sigma Ring and Generated Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§20 p.76 / PDF 85, definition preceding 20.3"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"existence-and-minimality-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>在 ZFC 中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Lambda,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\Lambda^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 为从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span> 的全函数集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaRing}(X,\\Lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaRing}(X,\\Lambda)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\sigma_X(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 由下式引入，补集均相对于 X。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaRing}(X,\\Lambda)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;X\\in\\Lambda\\land\\bigl(\\forall A\\in\\Lambda\\;(X\\setminus A\\in\\Lambda)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall F\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}F(j)\\in\\Lambda)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SigmaRing}(X,\\Lambda)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;X\\in\\Lambda\\land\\bigl(\\forall A\\in\\Lambda\\;(X\\setminus A\\in\\Lambda)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall F\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}F(j)\\in\\Lambda)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X(\\Gamma):=\\bigcap\\{\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Lambda\\land\\operatorname{SigmaRing}(X,\\Lambda)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma_X(\\Gamma):=\\bigcap\\{\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Lambda\\land\\operatorname{SigmaRing}(X,\\Lambda)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿用原书的 σ-ring 一词；它要求包含 X 且对 X 中补集闭合，通常也称 σ-algebra。不可静默换成只对集合差闭合而不含 X 的另一种 sigma ring 定义。候选族非空，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> 属于其中；交集仍含 X、Γ，并在相对补集及可数并下闭合，故生成类存在且为最小者。X 为空时定义仍成立。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda,\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaRing}(X,\\Lambda)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_X(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaRing}(X,\\Lambda)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;X\\in\\Lambda\\land\\bigl(\\forall A\\in\\Lambda\\;(X\\setminus A\\in\\Lambda)\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\forall F\\in\\Lambda^{\\mathbb N}\\;(\\bigcup_{j\\in\\mathbb N}F(j)\\in\\Lambda)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma_X(\\Gamma):=\\bigcap\\{\\Lambda\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Lambda\\land\\operatorname{SigmaRing}(X,\\Lambda)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1606,"backlinks":[{"id":"61df304a04864967","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$X_{m,k}$ 见 [[68-df-baire-space]]；$\\mathrm{RecursiveReal}^{(m,k)}$ 是 [[68-df-recursive-real-relation]] 中无固定外加实参数的递归关系类。生成算子 $\\sigma_X$ 见 [[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]。$A\\subseteq X_{m,k}$。"},{"id":"c0d1050ea9a023f8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $n\\ge1$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\boldsymbol\\Delta_n^{1,(m,k)}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X_{m,k})$ 沿用 [[68-thm-projective-sections]]；$\\operatorname{SigmaRing}$ 见 [[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]。"},{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-86","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-133","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-sigma-ring-of-relations|df-sigma-ring-of-relations — Shoenfield Sigma Ring and Generated Class]]"}],"outgoing":[]}